  "description": "WUWROY crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group P 21 3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C75 H72 N9 O20 Tb3 Zn3 4+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),2(H1 O1 1-),8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Tb1D (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1D (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Tb1H (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1H (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.484-3.872 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.09-110.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn3Tb3(O2)L3(PyCO2)3](OH)2(ClO4)2·8H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
